      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Version control lecture scope:\n1. Recap.\n  1.1 git initialization\n  1.2 track files\n  1.3 Commit files\n  1.4 Merging\n  1.5 cherry-pick\n  1.6 rebase\n2. What are the top popular tools that implement the VC ?\n  2.1 Github\n  2.3 GitLab\n  2.4 Gittea\n3. What is github ?\n4. Implement the git actions but on remote server\n5. What is the flow that most companies are using in order to incremently add features\n6. Activity \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Version control lecture scope:\n1. Recap.\n  1.1 git initialization\n  1.2 track files\n  1.3 Commit files\n  1.4 Merging\n  1.5 cherry-pick\n  1.6 rebase\n2. What are the top popular tools that implement the VC ?\n  2.1 Github\n  2.3 GitLab\n  2.4 Gittea\n3. What is github ?\n4. Implement the git actions but on remote server\n5. What is the flow that most companies are using in order to incremently add features\n6. Activity \n\n",
